    "_comment": "Landing (1,7) sits inside the alleys' own west corridor, open + off every blocked/entity cell there. v0.16.1 #9: this was a free-standing `door` on open paving -- rows 2..15 had no wall east of x=24, so the city's only alley entrance had plaza on all four sides. There is a building there now (x=26 masonry, sealed east at [27,3], floor_layer 6 behind it) and this entity is the BREAK in it: hide_sprite, so the three-cell gap at y7..9 is what the player reads. TRAP: row 2 stays open x0..27 (invrisil_walkthrough paces it to grind to night), so the north end seals at [27,3], never [26,2] -- without that one cell the masonry is a SCREEN, the lane behind it open off the plaza at (27,2).",
